==============================================================================
refused lifecycle: attempt 1 + REFUSED TLR   verification=UNVERIFIABLE    standing=UNVERIFIABLE reason=STANDING_EVIDENCE_SIGNATURE_INVALID  env-reasons=['EVIDENCE_INVALID:dns', 'EVIDENCE_INVALID:repo', 'NO_AUTHORITY_EVIDENCE']
