refused lifecycle: attempt 1 alone           verification=UNVERIFIABLE    standing=ABSENT       reason=NO_TERMINAL_DISPOSITION_EVIDENCE  env-reasons=['EVIDENCE_INVALID:dns', 'EVIDENCE_INVALID:repo', 'NO_AUTHORITY_EVIDENCE']
TLR(REFUSED) fields: ['binding', 'lineage', 'terminal'] | lineage entry fields: ['anchor_ref', 'disposition', 'handle', 'ordinal']
A3.7.2 portable refusal record fields (from the amendment text): attempt identity, disposition, disclosable reasons, evidence needed to verify it; plus a non-identifying public commitment value.
overlap: attempt identity (handle), disposition. TLR lacks: reasons, commitment value. Refusal record lacks: the full attempt lineage with anchor refs.
